  90 days') was never checked at all. Reuses AssemblyAgent's existing
  sentence-stripping so unsupported claims are removed before reaching
  the user, same as citation-based flags.
- Upload: finalise_chunked_upload no longer runs parse->embed->index
  synchronously inside the HTTP request (risked proxy timeouts and
  blocked a FastAPI worker for the full duration on multi-GB files).
  Now dispatches a Celery chain (parse_document | embed_document) and
  returns immediately with a trackable document_id; background=False
  param keeps the old synchronous path available for small/dev use.
- Upload: added GET /upload/document/{id}/status to poll ingestion
  stage (parsing/embedding/indexing/complete) for the new async path.
- Upload: single-shot endpoint now streams to disk in 8MB chunks
  instead of loading the whole file into memory with file.read().
