  chunk in a loop) — this was the exact bug already fixed in
  ingest.py's _write_chunks_to_db, but this independent Celery code
  path had silently regressed back to it. Now uses the same batched
  executemany pattern. Also accepts a pre-generated document_id so
  the API can return a trackable ID immediately.
